PawnIO + LpcIO.bin (Windows SuperIO helper)
  Author: namazso and contributors
  https://github.com/namazso/PawnIO
  https://github.com/namazso/PawnIO.Modules
  LpcIO.bin + IsaBridgeEC.bin vendored from PawnIO.Modules release 0.2.11
  (crates/chromaflow-lpc/modules/)
  LpcIO.bin SHA256: B3896A1CAB0D808FCA31FE2EBCAE045D59DAC690DA87B17C858BB8DA357EB45E
  IsaBridgeEC.bin SHA256: 2C5EC9D09BA42C980C917F83F528E9643CEEE386C84FFA8765C521CD1BBBA304
  PawnIO is installed separately (winget id namazso.PawnIO). ChromaFlow’s
  elevated chromaflow-lpc loads PawnIOLib.dll + those modules; it does not
  ship WinRing0. Gigabyte AMD boards often need IsaBridgeEC (MMIO) when
  classic LpcIO chip-ID reads return 0xFFFF.

